sharkcordclient communicates with a user-supplied Sharkord server
instance. The Sharkord name is used here only for factual, descriptive
identification of the upstream project this client targets. All
trademarks and project names belong to their respective owners.

This client implements the Sharkcord network protocol (tRPC over
WebSocket, mediasoup WebRTC signaling, and the documented HTTP
endpoints) as an independent work based on the public, MIT-licensed
upstream source. No Sharkord source code is included in this
repository.